{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments ["<b>גפן</b> — in the language of a standing noun. The meaning is 'You transported,' and they are Israel, for 'the vineyard of YHWH of hosts.'" "And the meaning of תסיע — because of their going in the wilderness." "<b>תגרש גוים</b> — You made the seven nations inherit and planted it, like 'You brought them and planted them.'"], :book :psalms, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 80, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Psalms -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/tehilim"] ["Wikisource Mikraot Gedolot" "http://en.wikisource.org/wiki/Mikraot_Gedolot/"] ["Tanakh, Venice, 1617-1619" "https://dlib.rsl.ru/viewer/01007514045#?page=4"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:35:32.049721406Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}